{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731320/extras/Desc1.gif?t=1747551419\" /><strong>This is the demo version of <i>Battle Shadow Arena</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can experience the core 1v1 boss battle system up to Stage 4.<br>Get a preview of the combat style and core mechanics featured in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Some features are limited in the demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo ends after clearing Stage 4.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character enhancement is locked and available only in the full version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 3 passive skill slots are available, limiting build combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only 7 active skills can be used; many weapon-specific skills are unavailable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle cards are limited to 3 preset cards and cannot be changed or customized.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The full version includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 bosses and 10 diverse combat stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full freedom to combine weapons and elemental skills for custom playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 60 passive skills and full access to the battle card system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete character growth and stat enhancement features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The full version launches on June 4, 2025.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add it to your wishlist and discover your own answers through relentless combat.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731320?t=1747551419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c